hi everyone this is matt nava from giant  squid  i'm excited to share more with you today  about our upcoming game the pathless  the pathless is an open world mythic  adventure game set in a vast forest  you play as the hunter who along with  your eagle companion  seeks to lift a curse of darkness that  plagues the world  the hunter is a master of archery she  can shoot talismans to fill her dash  meter which allows her to bound across  the landscape  fluid dynamic movement is at the core of  the pathless  so the game's unique take on archery is  all about timing  not aiming down sights this design was  critical  to making it possible to shoot even  while moving fast and performing  acrobatic maneuvers  you instantly feel as skilled as the  hunter herself  with help from the eagle you can even  fly  bond between the hunter and the eagle is  central in the pathos  [Music]  you can gain altitude while you glide by  [Music]  flapping  make sure you pet the eagle to keep it  clean and in good flying condition  you'll find secrets all over the island  if you know where to look  collecting crystals will let you upgrade  the eagle's ability to flap  [Music]  you'll also discover larger puzzles to  solve in ancient structures  [Music]  the pathless is all about finding your  own way forward so unlike most open  world games there's no map instead  the hunter can use her mask to peer into  the spirit world  and discover distant landmarks it even  shows you where you've been  getting to higher vantage points will  let you see further with spirit vision  [Music]  giant cursed spirits the source of the  darkness will pose a constant threat to  you on your quest  they will try to separate you from the  eagle  stay still in the light to avoid  detection  me  you won't be able to take on the cursed  spirits until you've returned light to  the obelisks  when the obelisks are restored the  cursed spirits will be vulnerable  chase them down through the forest to  corner them in a dramatic final battle  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  the hunter and eagle will have to defeat  the cursed spirits to bring light back  to the world  i hope you've enjoyed this overview of  the pathless  we've only scratched the surface there's  so much more to explore  and discover hypothesis is coming out  later this year  thanks for watching  [Music]
 

